text: >-
  Morgan •

  @MorganC000 • 4h

  G...

  Sooo there's no verifiable record of Lance Twiggs—no addresses, licenses,

  or history. His name only appears in press coverage of the Kirk shooting.

  The figure that does exist is Jerry Tyler Twiggs, a St. George pediatrician
  tied

  to Intermountain Healthcare through Dixie Pediatrics. Intermountain runs

  pediatrics, psychiatry, and crisis programs, making it a prime recipient of

  new behavioral-health funding.

  Public records show Jerry with multiple aliases and residences across

  several states, plus relatives tied to medical-supply and behavioral-health

  ventures. This positions the family in both clinical services and supply

  chains-exactly where funding flows after a high-profile "mental health

  crisis."

  When Jerry surfaced in the media as the "grandfather" of Lance, it placed a

  verifiable figure with deep medical ties at the center of the story. His

  presence connected the event to an established network in pediatrics and

  behavioral health, positioned to gain from new funding.

  IVV155°

  # Birth Information

  Age

  49

  Born

  NOV 1975

  KNOWN ALIASES

  Center; Rehabilitation center; Wound Clinic,

  NICU and Community Health and

  Information Center.

  Fee: Fee counseling and payment plans

  available

  Lance Twiggs, seen here, the roommate of main

  suspect Tyler Robinson, 22, made the shock remark in

  BANANAN

  Service #'s:

  • Behavioral Medicine: Innatient nsvchiatric
